## 1.0 Project

**Name:** smoke
**Description:** Disposable AEL smoke-test target. Not a real project.

**Technology stack:** Python 3.11 | pytest
**Target platform:** macOS

> Note: `bin/propagate.sh` does not exclude `ai/context.md`, so this file is
> overwritten by the framework template on every propagation and must be
> restored afterwards. See issue-a2f9c4d1 notes.

[Return to Table of Contents](<#table of contents>)

