## 2.0 Commands

Tests are executed by the orchestrator's pytest gate, not by the worker.
The worker has no execution tool and must not attempt to run commands.

| Action | Command |
|---|---|
| Test | `pytest tests/` (orchestrator-invoked) |

[Return to Table of Contents](<#table of contents>)

